cagent_addons is an in-tree optional addon package for the cAGENT
embedded Agent core. Its OpenClaw Node protocol frames are designed for
wire compatibility with the openvela packages/ai_agent node
implementation, which is distributed under the Apache License 2.0;
the code in this package is an independent minimal implementation.
